{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43644","headline":"冬日建安寺西院喜昼公自吴兴至联句一首 · 清昼","name":"冬日建安寺西院喜昼公自吴兴至联句一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宗系传康乐，精修学远公。\n相寻当暮岁，行李犯寒风。\n累积浮生里，机慙半偈中。\n传家知业坠，继祖忝声同。\n云与轻帆至，山将本寺空。\n向来忘起灭，留我宿花宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}